1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Is the ferry on time today?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,000
It left ten minutes early.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,000
- Early? Then we take the bus.
- The bus is faster anyway.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,500
- Welcome back to the show.
- Thank you, Clara.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,000
<i>The harbour is closed</i>
<i>until Monday.</i>

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,000
The announcement ends here.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,400
We meet again next week.
